      "en": "A role is a set of responsibilities, not a person. One person may hold several roles — the Tech Lead may be whoever does the architecture, or even a junior, if the organisation so decides. The Manual prescribes what the role must do, not who does it. The only constraints on who are the incompatibilities.",
